sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-eb[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]sase xprompt show[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]`sase xprompt show <name>` renders any single xprompt or workflow [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]definition — its declared properties, inputs, local helpers, body, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and provenance — with the same xprompt syntax highlighting the ACE [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]prompt input bar uses, plus byte-faithful `--format raw` and stable[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`--format json` modes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]xprompt_show.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/xprompt_show.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-eb[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-eb/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared xprompt highlight core (roles, flattened spans, [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]palette)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]highlight[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]highlight: add the frontend-agnostic highlight role model, an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]overlap-flattening span merger over the existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]xprompt/jinja/alt/placeholder/artifact-ref scanners, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]flexoki-derived palette exposing Rich and ANSI styles; move the shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]argument-color blend out of the TUI mixin.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Definition resolution, provenance, and the JSON record[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]resolve[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolve: add name normalization and lookup with suggestions, source [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]classification and provenance (path, line, hosted URL, editability), [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]byte-faithful raw-definition extraction for every source bucket, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference scan, and the versioned show record with its JSON projection.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rich rendering of the show layout[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after highlight, resolve[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: build the Rich renderables for the header, properties, inputs, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]local xprompts, body with a line-number gutter and role styling, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]workflow steps, references, and hints; add the shared CLI chrome [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]palette.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]CLI wiring, help, and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: register the `show` subparser with its flags and examples, dispatch[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]it from the xprompt handler, document the command in the three docs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]surfaces, and retire the epic symvision whitelist entries.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-eb","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-eb.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-bd8f7dff8b0f791a375903f1ecc9e000","started_at":"2026-08-02T15:52:05.046412+00:00","state":"compl